  "name": "Asset Warranty Expiry Guardian — Never Miss A Warranty Or Renewal Deadline Again (Sheets → Gmail → Todoist → Slack)",
  "tags": [],
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "8e504d88-7104-41ed-85ed-1e1e24822dbf",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        -400,
        64
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "width": 520,
        "height": 800,
        "content": "## Asset Warranty Expiry Guardian\n\nLaptops, monitors, machines, licenses — every one of them has a warranty that quietly expires. This workflow reads your **asset register from Google Sheets** every morning, computes each item's warranty deadline and routes it through an escalation ladder:\n\n- **30 days left** → email the asset owner to decide: extend, replace or let it lapse. For assets worth ≥ 2000, an LLM also drafts a **vendor negotiation email** (saved as Gmail draft)\n- **7 days left** → urgent Slack alert + a Todoist task with a due date\n- **Already expired** → the register is updated to `warranty expired` so reports stay honest\n\n### 🔧 Setup\n1. Create a sheet with headers: `asset, owner_email, purchase_date, warranty_months, vendor, value, status`.\n2. Connect **Google Sheets**, **Gmail**, **OpenAI**, **Slack** and **Todoist** credentials.\n3. Select the sheet in **Read Asset Register** and **Mark As Expired**.\n4. Adjust the high-value threshold (2000) in **High-Value Asset?**.\n5. Activate — runs daily at **08:30**.\n\n### 💡 Why it's useful\nA single missed warranty claim on one broken laptop usually costs more than a year of running this workflow."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "859e2780-a9cc-4384-bad1-e96f6dc01fc0",
      "name": "Sticky Note1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        560,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 4,
        "width": 660,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "### 1️⃣ Compute deadlines\nExpiry date = purchase date + warranty months. Each asset gets `daysLeft` and is routed by urgency."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9fbe5ffc-53cd-423a-a85c-6a0c25ec49b7",
      "name": "Sticky Note2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1280,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 5,
        "width": 640,
        "height": 868,
        "content": "### 2️⃣ Escalation ladder\n 30 days: owner decides ·  7 days: Slack + Todoist task · 💀 expired: register updated."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "db790013-e7bc-40ba-b9fb-f44249a46bbc",
      "name": "Sticky Note3",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1984,
        720
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "color": 6,
        "width": 700,
        "height": 460,
        "content": "### 3️⃣ High-value negotiation\nFor expensive assets, the LLM drafts a warranty-extension negotiation email to the vendor — saved as a Gmail draft for you to review and send."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
